    "Lens intentionally opaque pale blue, zonules ivory, cornea alpha-blended: illustrative teaching materials, not measured optics."
  ],
  "sourceGaps": [
    "Right anterior-segment layer study only: 7 selected HRA components, 16 source meshes excluded. Not a polished whole eye or exterior replacement. Source corneal rim and zonule insertion uncertainty remain; no optics, motion, clinical or runtime pass.",
    "仅右眼前节分层研究：选取7个HRA结构，排除16个来源网格。不代表完整眼球精修或外观替代。保留来源角膜边缘及晶状体悬韧带附着不确定性；未通过光学、运动、临床或运行验证。"
  ],
  "criticalNotes": [
    {
      "en": "The opaque cyan lens is an illustrative material, not pupil tissue or optical realism. Source rim faceting, open surfaces and two inherited ciliary-muscle degenerate triangles remain.",
      "zh": "不透明青色晶状体为示意材质，不是瞳孔组织，也不代表真实光学。保留来源边缘棱面、开放表面及睫状肌中2个退化三角面。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Whole/cutaway controls retain source transforms and camera pose. Fit/source-view buttons intentionally reset the camera; mode switching does not.",
      "zh": "完整/剖面切换保留来源变换与相机姿态。适配/来源视图按钮会主动重置相机，模式切换不会。"
    }
  ],
